anslate(180.75125 291.84) rotate(-40)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">current</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="224.37343750000002" y="124" height="148" width="26.77109375" fill="#B3B3B3" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="251.14453125000003" y="152" height="120" width="26.77109375" fill="#333333" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="end" transform="translate(261.06453125 291.84) rotate(-40)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">moderate change</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="304.68671875" y="224" height="48" width="26.77109375" fill="#B3B3B3" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="331.4578125" y="240" height="32" width="26.77109375" fill="#333333" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="end" transform="translate(341.3778125 291.84) rotate(-40)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">extreme change</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(251.14453125 24)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Modeled Radial Growth of </text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(251.14453125 48)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Sugar Maple Trees</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(251.14453125 410.77701171875)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Climate scenario</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" x="120.59765625" y="427.93701171875" height="71" width="173.8046875" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http:/